WEBVTT

00:12:26.107 --> 00:12:31.593
or just as people learn Latin
in order to read the classics,

00:12:31.617 --> 00:12:32.951
it's the same thing.

00:12:33.489 --> 00:12:34.918
CA: It's so interesting.

00:12:34.942 --> 00:12:37.862
You could use your earbud
to go into the basics

00:12:37.886 --> 00:12:39.227
of living in another country

00:12:39.251 --> 00:12:42.299
and learn the language to dive deep
into its culture and history.

00:12:42.323 --> 00:12:45.337
You can imagine it playing out
lots of different ways, actually.

00:12:45.361 --> 00:12:47.068
And I've always wanted to try this:

00:12:47.092 --> 00:12:49.631
hey, Alexa, turn up the volume
on this podcast,

00:12:49.655 --> 00:12:51.702
because Kai-Fu Lee is really interesting.

00:12:52.551 --> 00:12:54.410
Just in case anyone's listening on ...

00:12:54.434 --> 00:12:57.577
KFL: You're messing up
people's home environments with that.

00:12:57.601 --> 00:13:00.672
CA: (Laughs) Sorry.